  "explanation": "Detect cycle in directed graph using DFS. Maintain a visiting recursion set to detect cycles in current path, and clear preMap[course] to empty once confirmed acyclic.",
  "pseudoCode": "FUNCTION canFinish(numCourses, prerequisites):\n    preMap = HASH_MAP_OF_LISTS(), visited = SET()\n    FOR req IN prerequisites DO APPEND req[1] TO preMap[req[0]]\n    FUNCTION dfs(crs):\n        IF crs IN visited THEN RETURN False\n        IF preMap[crs] IS EMPTY THEN RETURN True\n        ADD crs TO visited\n        FOR pre IN preMap[crs] DO:\n            IF NOT dfs(pre) THEN RETURN False\n        END FOR\n        REMOVE crs FROM visited; preMap[crs] = []\n        RETURN True\n    END FUNCTION\n    FOR c FROM 0 TO numCourses - 1 DO:\n        IF NOT dfs(c) THEN RETURN False\n    END FOR\n    RETURN True\nEND FUNCTION",
  "renderType": "dag_cycle_check",
  "initialData": {
